      ***   start event editor code   ***
      *
       Exit-Btn-Ex-Cmd-Clicked.
            perform Acu-exit-rtn
           .
      *
       Form2-Close-Btn-Ex-Cmd-Clicked. 
      * Perform updates 
      * if processing successful
           move zero to form2-handle
           Stop thread
      * else
      * display message box
      * end-if
           .
      *
      *
       Form2-Change-Push-Btn-Ex-Cmd-Clicked.
      * Perform updates 
      * if processing successful
           Set I-O window to form1-handle
      * else
      * display message box     
           .
      *
       Admissions-Btn-Ex-Cmd-Clicked.
           If form2-handle > zero 
           then
               Set I-O window to form2-handle 
           else
               Perform thread Acu-Form2-routine
           .
      *
       Student-recs-Btn-Ex-Cmd-Clicked.
           if form3-handle > 0
           then
               set I-O window to form3-handle
           else
               Perform thread Acu-Form3-routine
           .
      *
       Form3-Close-Btn-Ex-Cmd-Clicked.
            move zero to form3-handle
            Stop thread
           .
      *
       Form2-Change-Push-Btn-Ev-Cmd-Clicked.
            Set I-O window to form1-handle
           .
      *
       Form1-Bef-Create.
            move zero to form1-handle,
                form2-handle,
                form3-handle
           .
       
